{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日12月2日に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Men's JOKERWATCH"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売されます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールで撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても、大人っぽく素敵に撮ってもらいました(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやくオフショットも載せたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性向けファッション誌で、男性のファンの方は手に取りやすいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールで載せてもらってるページは、\n「Men's JOKER WATCH」の中にあるページの「SJ WATCH」という特集に載せてもらっていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールは女性ものの時計をつけているので、女性のファンの方にも楽しんでもらえると思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスプレゼントに時計が欲しいと思っていた方は、是非参考にしてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外ハネりんごヘアー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんぷちゃんヘアーとは\nちょっと違うよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から12月ですね！！！\n師走や！師走！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間や！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていへんや！ていへんや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつお部屋片付けしないと\n大晦日までに間に合わなくなっちゃうから、頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その前にいまは\nとにかくアンダーライブとクリスマスライブに専念します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目が開かないくらい\n笑ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ちゃんも夢の国\nたのしみっちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は11月29日の幕張個別握手会の時の写真を紹介します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は、塩アイスでおそろいの\nジェラートピケのルームウェアを着たよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外ハネに\n夢の国で買ったピン留めを\nつけました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナゲットみたいとか\nうにみたいとか\n散々言われたけど、\nちょっと自分でもそうみえるかも。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、はちみつ大好きなあのくまさんだから！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身写真！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部が、紺とピンクのボーダー柄\nタートルニットにオーバーオール着ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番最初に載せた写真の洋服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身撮り忘れちゃったごめんね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部は、赤チェックの\nゆるゆるだらだらワンピースに\n紺色のニット帽！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛は1つにくくっただけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年最後の関東での握手会でした！\n今年もう最後！という方もたくさんいらっしゃって寂しかったです(；ω；)。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブやアンダーライブに来てくださる方もたくさんいらっしゃって嬉しかったです(｡・・｡)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の握手会も残りはあと\n12月26日の名古屋全国握手会と\n12月27日の名古屋個別握手会だけですね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーーー\n寂しい(ノω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんともっと直接会って\n一緒に過ごせる時間が増えたら\nいいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのためにも頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/01/8070978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい！！！"}],"source":"archive"}